codex
The launcher issue was isolated to the sandbox’s nested PID namespace: Lean queried `/proc/<inner-pid>/exe`, while only `/proc/self/exe` is visible. I reproduced the failure, added a narrowly scoped temporary read-only path shim under `/tmp/audit-work` (it redirects only that executable-path probe), confirmed the pinned Lean commit, and am rerunning preflight without changing any audited artifact.
